
About "mine"
============

Mine is the ROCK Linux package manager. Please read the file GEM-MINE for
details.


Installing
==========

Simply type "make" and "make install".


Redistributed Source
====================

This source distribution of "mine" contains sources from the following other
packages. "mine" does not depend on any external library except the libc
and the following libraries which are statically linked with "mine" and are
part of this source distribution:

 * cdb-0.75/ contains the cdb 0.75 distribution as available for download
   from the cdb homepage <http://cr.yp.to/cdb.html> with the cdb-0.75.patch
   patch (as found in this directory) applied.

 * libtar-1.2.5/ contains the libtar 1.2.5 distribution as available for
   download from the libtar homepage <http://www-dev.cso.uiuc.edu/libtar/>.

 * bzip-1.0.2/ contains the bzip2 1,0,2 distribution as available for download
   from the bzip2 homepage <http://sources.redhat.com/bzip2/>.

